        <div class="quiz-item" id="q1">
          <div class="quiz-q">
            <span class="qnum">Question 01 / 05</span>
            What is the primary difference between static and dynamic malware analysis?
          </div>
          <div class="options">
            <button class="opt-btn"><span class="opt-letter">A</span>Static uses a debugger; dynamic uses a disassembler</button>
            <button class="opt-btn"><span class="opt-letter">B</span>Static examines the file without executing it; dynamic runs it in a controlled environment</button>
            <button class="opt-btn"><span class="opt-letter">C</span>Static analysis is only for Linux malware; dynamic is for Windows</button>
